{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a crew of alien misfits with unique abilities who stand in the way of the reality-eating chronospheres. These massive structures consume planets and reproduce their biomes and inhabitants within. Reach the core of all the chronospheres and stop the destruction of the universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/SteamHeader_TurnBasedAction.png?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/gif_1_turnBasedNature.gif?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A roguelike tactics game like no other. Play at your own pace, alternating between bold action and careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/SteamHeader_UnlockCharacters.png?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/HeroLineup_transparent.gif?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit alien crew-members, each with unique abilities from bullet-reflecting kinetic surges to good old-fashioned dodge rolls, after you\u2019ve proven your worth by completing missions and destroying Chronospheres. After all, who doesn\u2019t want to be part of the winning team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/SteamHeader_FightWeirdEnemeies.png?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/Enemy_Lineup.gif?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cowboys with knives, clockwork lifeforms, parasitic insect swarms, diesel-powered mole-men, and war-torn hellscapes are only some of the wild combinations a Chronosphere will create after consuming a world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/SteamHeader_ExoticWeaponsAndItems.png?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/acid-sac.gif?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find unique weapons and abilities, and create loadouts blending gear and skills from different worlds. You can fight at close or long range, push enemies away or toward you, shoot flames from behind, or spatter acid puddles when you shoot. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/SteamHeader_ProtectTheUniverse.png?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rules of physics melt inside a Chronosphere: anticipate distortions, mutations, and plunderable paradoxes. Flow seamlessly between real-time action and turn-based tactics. Choose between stabilizing your wounds or saving reality. The deeper you go, the weirder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/TheGlimmeringWay.png?t=1738066454\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/Steam_GlyphBreak.png?t=1738066454\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1969810?t=1738066454","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738066454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738066454","